From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 13:47:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add real-time 1:1 chat feature (WebSocket/STOMP)

Separate user-to-user messenger, independent from the existing PO-detail
mock comment tab. Backend uses Spring WebSocket/STOMP with JWT auth on
the CONNECT frame; frontend adds a ChatPage with a room list, contact
picker, and live message thread via @stomp/stompjs.

